Author: clever-wolf-203 <clever-wolf-203@invalid>
Date:   Sun Nov 15 19:08:33 2026 +0000

    prep: close review 95713 -- single helper mint + honest comment rung
    
    - Add helper_release_locus_record(locus, spine, revision): the ONE mint for the
      root-helper snapshot shape. The port derives its directory once from (locus, revision)
      via the mint, instead of two call sites hand-computing helper_locus_dir beside an
      independent revision argument (review 95713 Finding 2 -- that was the very split this
      record exists to remove). dark_helper_snapshot_at now takes the minted ReleaseLocus and
      installs it directly (no hand-built record literal); the loose dir: String parameter and
      the two hand-copied call sites are gone.
    - Weaken the ReleaseLocus comment to the rung the code establishes (review 95713 Finding 1,
      guarantee_ladder): the constructor is public, so the two folds are the sanctioned mints,
      not an unwritable-record guarantee. The previous "cannot disagree / unwritable" claim was
      rung inflation.
    
