+// THE ONE MINT FOR THE ROOT-HELPER SNAPSHOT SHAPE. Its directory is helper_locus_dir(locus, revision) --
+// derived from the SAME revision the record carries, so the two port call sites (deploy_apply_ports_on_host
+// and the fleet board-function converge delivery) mint it once instead of hand-computing the directory
+// beside an independent revision argument (review 95713: a hand-copied dir could drift from the revision
+// it was built for -- the very split this record exists to remove). The spine is a caller-supplied list
+// (the helper's parent dirs are not derived from base_root the way the release spine is).
+fn helper_release_locus_record(locus: HelperLocus, spine: List<String>, revision: ReleaseRevisionBinding) -> ReleaseLocus {
+  ReleaseLocus {
+    base_root: locus.base,
+    revision: revision,
+    spine: spine,
+    locus: helper_locus_dir(locus: locus, revision: revision),
+  }
+}
